🌳 1. What exactly is Red-Black Tree (Deep Understanding)
It is a self-balancing Binary Search Tree (BST)
Every node contains:
key
left, right child
parent
color (RED / BLACK)
Used when we need:
sorted data
fast search, insert, delete → O(log n)

🧠 2. Node Structure (Very Important)
class Node {
    int key;
    Node left, right, parent;
    boolean color; // RED = true, BLACK = false
}

🌳 3. Core Properties (Must Follow Always)
⭐ Property 1
Every node is either RED or BLACK
⭐ Property 2
Root is always BLACK
⭐ Property 3
No two RED nodes are adjacent
RED → RED ❌ not allowed
